WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.444
USIS-SAM keeps SAM's pretrained backbone frozen and
adds two lightweight modules.

00:00:05.524 --> 00:00:11.445
The Underwater Adaptive ViT encoder injects domain
knowledge through adapters: a channel

00:00:11.525 --> 00:00:13.491
adapter recalibrates features,

00:00:13.571 --> 00:00:19.015
while multi-scale convolutions of size three, five,
and seven capture structures,

00:00:19.095 --> 00:00:22.151
balanced by average residuals to dampen noise.

00:00:22.231 --> 00:00:27.266
On top, the Salient Feature Prompt Generator
replaces SAM's manual prompts.

00:00:27.346 --> 00:00:33.335
Its Salient Feature Fusion Module aggregates
features from each UA-ViT block and produces

00:00:33.415 --> 00:00:36.063
salient prompt embeddings automatically,

00:00:36.143 --> 00:00:37.904
feeding SAM's mask decoder.

00:00:37.984 --> 00:00:43.360
It trains end-to-end with a combined region,
classification, box, and mask loss.
